<VI _name="Sim Plant.lvclass:Tick.vi" description="One plant step\3A now = Tick Count ms\2C State = Plant First Order Step(State\2C Setpoints\2C dt 0.1 s\2C now)\2C then sends the new State to the caller (the executor) as Process Feedback Msg. Message: Plant Tick Msg (no payload)\2C sent to self every 100 ms by Time-Delayed Send Message.">
